msgid ":mod:`!cgi` --- Common Gateway Interface support"
msgstr ":mod:`!cgi` --- Dukungan Common Gateway Interface"

msgid ""
"This module is no longer part of the Python standard library. It "
"was :ref:`removed in Python 3.13 <whatsnew313-pep594>` after being "
"deprecated in Python 3.11.  The removal was decided in :pep:`594`."
msgstr ""
"Modul ini bukan lagi bagian dari pustaka standar Python. Modul "
"ini :ref:`dihapus pada Python 3.13 <whatsnew313-pep594>` setelah dinyatakan "
"usang pada Python 3.11. Penghapusan ini ditetapkan dalam :pep:`594`."

msgid ""
"A fork of the module on PyPI can be used instead: :pypi:`legacy-cgi`. This "
"package contains copies of the :mod:`!cgi` and :mod:`!cgitb` modules, which "
"are no longer maintained or supported by the core Python team."
msgstr ""
"Fork modul ini di PyPI dapat digunakan sebagai pengganti: :pypi:`legacy-"
"cgi`. Paket ini berisi salinan modul :mod:`!cgi` dan :mod:`!cgitb`, yang "
"tidak lagi dipelihara atau didukung oleh tim inti Python."

msgid ""
"The last version of Python that provided the :mod:`!cgi` module was `Python "
"3.12 <https://docs.python.org/3.12/library/cgi.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"Versi terakhir Python yang menyediakan modul :mod:`!cgi` adalah `Python 3.12 "
"<https://docs.python.org/3.12/library/cgi.html>`_."
